WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:03.203
-Fred, you are about to be
a guest on the show as well.

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:03.636 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:04.671 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I just hope
you've thought through

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:05.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
how you're going to
play yourself on

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:07.874 align:start size:94% position:6%
while also moving
from there to here.

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:09.509 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think I have an idea.
-Okay, great.

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:12.812
Our first guests tonight are two
very funny comedians and actors

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:15.015
you know from their work
on "Saturday Night Live."

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:17.917 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're producing and starring
in the new show "Forever,"

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:20.587 size:81% position:41%
which begins streaming
on Amazon Prime Video,

00:00:20.587 --> 00:00:22.255 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Friday, September 14th.

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:23.490 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Let's take a look.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:26.259 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow.
-Wow.

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:28.395 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-How gorgeous is this?

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:31.598 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is so beautiful.
-I know.

00:00:31.598 --> 00:00:33.800 line:92%
-Such a good idea, honey.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.236 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Thank you.

00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:40.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
Jesus mother[bleep] Christ,
that's cold!

00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:41.708 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:42.609 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Good Lord. Jesus.

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:45.345 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is it gonna be that cold
everywhere?

00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:47.547 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is it that bad?
You're scaring me.

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:50.417
-Please welcome back to the
show, two of my favorite people,

00:00:50.417 --> 00:00:52.719 align:start size:94% position:6%
Maya Rudolph and Fred Armisen,
everybody.

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:54.621 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:54.621 --> 00:01:02.662 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:10.637 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:01:10.637 --> 00:01:18.578 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:26.286 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:31.291 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:31.991 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well done.
-Hi.

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:33.026 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You thought it through.
-We did.

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:36.029
-You really thought it through.
I am very impressed.

00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:36.563 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Thank you.

00:01:36.563 --> 00:01:37.864 align:start size:94% position:6%
-These are for you.
-These are for me? Thank you.

00:01:37.864 --> 00:01:41.568
Guys, this is so exciting.
You're doing a TV show together.

00:01:41.568 --> 00:01:42.669 line:92%
Obviously you met on "SNL."

00:01:42.669 --> 00:01:44.771 align:start size:94% position:6%
But you had seen Fred perform
before that?

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:49.809
-I did. I saw him at a club
in Los Angeles called Largo.

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:54.114
I think I had just started "SNL"
and I saw him --

00:01:54.114 --> 00:01:56.149 align:start size:94% position:6%
He didn't see me.
Like, we didn't talk.

00:01:56.149 --> 00:01:59.686 line:92%
But he had bleach blond hair

00:01:59.686 --> 00:02:04.924 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he was in a piece he wrote
with Mary Lynn Rajskub,

00:02:04.924 --> 00:02:08.061 align:start size:94% position:6%
where they were
these Hawaiian --

00:02:08.061 --> 00:02:10.396 align:start size:94% position:6%
What were you?
Conspiracy theorists?

00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:11.431 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.431 --> 00:02:13.700 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And your name was
Leonard Wampanui.

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:14.634 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:16.903 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we'd play audio tapes
of politicians --

00:02:16.903 --> 00:02:19.873
George Bush at the time --
and we'd be like, "Think."

00:02:19.873 --> 00:02:21.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Think.
-"Use your head."

00:02:21.241 --> 00:02:22.375 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Use your head.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.375 --> 00:02:26.479
And he -- immediately I was
like, "That guy's a beast."

00:02:26.479 --> 00:02:27.180 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:27.881 size:84% position:42% line:92%
That guy is so amazing.

00:02:27.881 --> 00:02:31.684
And then I didn't see him again
until I came to the auditions.

00:02:31.684 --> 00:02:34.420 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he was dressed as Fericito
for his audition.

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:37.657 align:start size:94% position:6%
-One of the -- an early
character he did on the show.

00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:41.060
Another early thing you guys did
together were the Nunis.

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:41.494 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:02:41.494 --> 00:02:43.897 align:start size:94% position:6%
-For those of you who don't
remember the Nunis,

00:02:43.897 --> 00:02:46.366 align:start size:94% position:6%
you guys were sort of --
Where were you from?

00:02:46.366 --> 00:02:47.333 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Good question.
-Yeah.

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:49.569 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We never knew.
-It felt like Holland.

00:02:49.569 --> 00:02:50.336 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Were we German? Dutch?

00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:52.705 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You were like -- you were
a design couple.

00:02:52.705 --> 00:02:53.907 line:92%
You had very unique designs.

00:02:53.907 --> 00:02:54.674 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.674 --> 00:02:57.277 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's Rainn Wilson
sitting on a pile of toast.

00:02:57.277 --> 00:02:59.212 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We always
had different chairs.

00:02:59.212 --> 00:03:00.747 line:92%
You're in a basketball hoop.

00:03:00.747 --> 00:03:01.714 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-That's me there, right?

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:03.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's you, yes.
-Oh, yeah.

00:03:03.583 --> 00:03:04.117 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:05.752
-By the way, if you had offered
me $1,000,

00:03:05.752 --> 00:03:08.488 align:start size:94% position:6%
I would not have been able to
tell you if I --

00:03:08.488 --> 00:03:09.455 size:81% position:41% line:92%
that's how long ago --

00:03:09.455 --> 00:03:10.590 line:92%
-I don't remember any of this.

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:13.593 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Who came up with the idea of
the Nunis?

00:03:13.593 --> 00:03:14.460 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-See, I don't know.

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:16.396 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think we all think
we all did,

00:03:16.396 --> 00:03:19.599 size:84% position:42%
because I knew this guy
in Holland named Hejen.

00:03:19.599 --> 00:03:21.267 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'd be like,
"Okay, hi, Hejen."

00:03:21.267 --> 00:03:24.037 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's like, "That's not how you
pronounce it."

00:03:24.037 --> 00:03:24.871 size:88% position:44% line:92%
And I would say "Hejen."

00:03:24.871 --> 00:03:27.073 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'm like,
"I am saying it right.

00:03:27.073 --> 00:03:27.640 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm not a dummy."

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.976 align:start size:94% position:6%
So he would just be like,
"No, that's not --

00:03:29.976 --> 00:03:30.777 line:92%
you're not doing it right."

00:03:30.777 --> 00:03:32.912
But then, you had a similar
story, and then James --

00:03:32.912 --> 00:03:35.748
-Well, my friend -- yeah, and we
wrote it with James Anderson

00:03:35.748 --> 00:03:37.984
'cause all great things
come from James Anderson.

00:03:37.984 --> 00:03:40.453
-One of the most prolific
writers in "SNL" history.

00:03:40.453 --> 00:03:41.788 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He's still alive.
-Still alive.

00:03:41.788 --> 00:03:42.322 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.322 --> 00:03:45.291
-My friend Gretchen told me she
went like, you know,

00:03:45.291 --> 00:03:47.694 align:start size:94% position:6%
a year abroad or whatever,
a summer abroad,

00:03:47.694 --> 00:03:50.330 align:start size:94% position:6%
after graduation
with her friend Shoshana.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.297 line:92%
And her name is Gretchen.

00:03:51.297 --> 00:03:53.099 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so they met
these Italian guys.

00:03:53.099 --> 00:03:55.902
And she was like, "I'm Gretchen.
This is Shoshana."

00:03:55.902 --> 00:03:58.271 size:78% position:39%
And the guy was like,
"Gracie, Shoshine.

00:03:58.271 --> 00:04:01.074 align:start size:94% position:6%
Come to the disco."
[ Laughter ]

00:04:01.074 --> 00:04:03.009
-'Cause the way it would work --
for example,

00:04:03.009 --> 00:04:06.312
when I was in the sketch, I'm
sure at one point I said Nuni.

00:04:06.312 --> 00:04:08.114 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-You were both named Nuni.

00:04:08.114 --> 00:04:09.449 line:92%
And that was your first name.

00:04:09.449 --> 00:04:11.117 line:92%
-But they were different names.

00:04:11.117 --> 00:04:11.784 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:04:11.784 --> 00:04:13.453 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But if I would say,
"So it's Nuni?"

00:04:13.453 --> 00:04:13.886 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes?

00:04:13.886 --> 00:04:16.256 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And Nuni.
-No, no, no, no. Nuni.

00:04:16.256 --> 00:04:18.291 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Nuni.
-Nuni. No, no. Nuni.

00:04:18.291 --> 00:04:19.759 line:92%
-No, she's Nuni, I'm Nuni.

00:04:19.759 --> 00:04:20.326 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:20.326 --> 00:04:24.297 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You have to say it
with the front of your tongue.

00:04:24.297 --> 00:04:24.897 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:24.897 --> 00:04:26.599 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Nuni.
-No, no. Nuni.

00:04:26.599 --> 00:04:28.334 size:84% position:42% line:92%
That is a child's name.

00:04:28.334 --> 00:04:29.836 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:29.836 --> 00:04:33.006 line:92%
-Also Prince, "The Prince Show."

00:04:33.006 --> 00:04:33.439 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:04:33.439 --> 00:04:34.641 line:92%
-And this was one of the best.

00:04:34.641 --> 00:04:37.343 align:start size:94% position:6%
-One of the best.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:37.343 --> 00:04:40.280 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Maya is Beyoncé.
Fred is Prince.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:42.315 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you guys --
There was a time

00:04:42.315 --> 00:04:45.151 align:start size:94% position:6%
where Prince
was the musical guest.

00:04:45.151 --> 00:04:45.585 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yep.

00:04:45.585 --> 00:04:48.521 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And you wrote a "Prince Show"
for Prince to be in.

00:04:48.521 --> 00:04:49.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-Yes.

00:04:49.188 --> 00:04:51.658 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And you had --
so I guess on Thursday,

00:04:51.658 --> 00:04:53.359 align:start size:94% position:6%
you lined up to try to
talk to Prince

00:04:53.359 --> 00:04:55.595 align:start size:94% position:6%
and settle on the idea
of the show.

00:04:55.595 --> 00:04:56.029 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:04:56.029 --> 00:04:57.230 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, and so we were poised
to speak to him

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:58.831 size:81% position:41%
after his sound check,
so we went down there.

00:04:58.831 --> 00:05:02.201
-And Prince's people had told
you, "Talk to him after that"?

00:05:02.201 --> 00:05:02.869 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Okay.

00:05:02.869 --> 00:05:05.038 size:81% position:41%
-We've got the script.
We showed it to him.

00:05:05.038 --> 00:05:05.571 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
He's gonna play,

00:05:05.571 --> 00:05:07.340 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then he's gonna
talk to you guys after this.

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:08.941 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay, great.
So the stage is right there,

00:05:08.941 --> 00:05:11.844 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we're standing right there
for Prince's sound check.

00:05:11.844 --> 00:05:12.712 line:92%
Like, what could be better?

00:05:12.712 --> 00:05:14.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she's like,
"As soon as he's done,

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.683 size:81% position:41%
he's gonna come over
and talk to you guys."

00:05:16.683 --> 00:05:18.851 size:88% position:44%
He finished, takes off
his little, like, stuff.

00:05:18.851 --> 00:05:21.054 align:start size:94% position:6%
Jumped off the stage,
walked directly towards us,

00:05:21.054 --> 00:05:24.791
made a 90-degree right turn past
us, walked out the double doors

00:05:24.791 --> 00:05:27.994 size:81% position:41%
and into the elevator
and left the building.

00:05:27.994 --> 00:05:30.596 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:30.596 --> 00:05:31.230 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Very Prince.

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:32.131 line:92%
-We never talked about it.

00:05:32.131 --> 00:05:35.401 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So I want to come back
after this commercial break

00:05:35.401 --> 00:05:37.003 line:92%
and talk about your new show.

00:05:37.003 --> 00:05:38.371 line:92%
But we are -- this is a sketch

00:05:38.371 --> 00:05:41.007 align:start size:94% position:6%
that has a lot more
historical significance

00:05:41.007 --> 00:05:43.643 align:start size:94% position:6%
than we maybe thought
at the time.

00:05:43.643 --> 00:05:45.044 line:92%
Paris Hilton was hosting.

00:05:45.044 --> 00:05:46.412 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Thank God.

00:05:46.412 --> 00:05:47.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:49.949 align:start size:94% position:6%
Not a show people
talk about a ton,

00:05:49.949 --> 00:05:53.720 align:start size:94% position:6%
but there we are
the three of us.

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:58.091 line:92%
Don Jr., Ivanka, Eric Trump.

00:05:58.091 --> 00:05:58.858 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:58.858 --> 00:05:59.425 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-What a picture.

00:05:59.425 --> 00:06:01.361 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That is so --
That is so upsetting.

00:06:01.361 --> 00:06:03.296 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That is a weird thing
that happened.

00:06:03.296 --> 00:06:06.132 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Was that the week
that you started the bet?

00:06:06.132 --> 00:06:06.999 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-I did have a bet, yeah.

00:06:06.999 --> 00:06:09.736 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The bet, was --
Can we talk about the bet?

00:06:09.736 --> 00:06:10.436 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-We might have to --

00:06:10.436 --> 00:06:13.072 align:start size:94% position:6%
We might edit it out,
but let's tell the story.

00:06:13.072 --> 00:06:14.440 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:19.946
-So, so, no one could really
get Paris Hilton, our host,

00:06:19.946 --> 00:06:21.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
to engage in
any personal conversations.

00:06:21.681 --> 00:06:25.118
We realized, she hasn't asked
any of us a personal question.

00:06:25.118 --> 00:06:25.752 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And this one said,

00:06:25.752 --> 00:06:28.554 align:start size:94% position:6%
"The first person she asks
a personal question,

00:06:28.554 --> 00:06:30.456 line:92%
I'll give --" a hundred bucks?

00:06:30.456 --> 00:06:30.890 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:32.458 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Didn't ask one person.
-No.

00:06:32.458 --> 00:06:32.959 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
No, right?

00:06:32.959 --> 00:06:34.193 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The whole week.
I thought she did.

00:06:34.193 --> 00:06:39.799
-No, she got close and she asked
Jodie, "Is Maya Italian?"

00:06:39.799 --> 00:06:41.768 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

